# Waivers for the image gates in .github/workflows/ci-cd.yml. One CVE per line,
# each with why it is waived and what lifts it.

# fastmcp 2.13.3 in the okta-mcp-server uv tool venv (mcp-packages/uv-tools.txt).
# okta-mcp-server pins fastmcp==2.13.3 exactly and has no later release; the fix
# is fastmcp 3.2.0. The flaw is in FastMCP's OpenAPI integration, which okta_mcp
# never imports. Drop this line when the okta pin moves past fastmcp 3.2.0.
CVE-2026-32871

# Go stdlib v1.26.4 inside usr/local/bin/restic (infra/docker/Dockerfile.backend).
# The image installs restic 0.19.1 by sha256, and 0.19.1 is restic's latest
# release, built on Go 1.26.4; the fix is Go 1.26.9 or 1.27.2. The flaw is
# Root.Mkdir/MkdirAll following a junction out of the root, which exists only on
# Windows (GHSA-c3q7-m35p-9qq7), and the image is Linux. Drop this line when
# restic ships a release built on Go 1.26.9 or later and the pin moves to it.
CVE-2026-56857
